 true, "dotnet_build_calls": 0, "edit_calls": 2, "ended_on_rejection": false, "error": null, "exec_mode": "local", "failure_class": "solved", "failure_reason": null, "faults_served": 0, "final_answer_complete": true, "final_answer_present": true, "final_answer_source": "json", "final_workspace": "/workspace/openbench-ab/results/omp-screen5-b2/omp-44-rerun/omp-44/cells/without/trig-omp-multistep/4/workspace", "fresh_subagents": 0, "harness": "omp", "harness_version": "omp/18.3.0 (/workspace/pi-check/cache5/bin/omp/7dd20b952257a3355c728716113cff772f7c5185/omp)", "harness_version_source": "host", "host": "grok-bot-vm-412615941", "image_digest": null, "last_activity_age_s": null, "list_has_generated": null, "main_agent_searched": false, "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "model_context_window": 1000000, "model_max_tokens": 128000, "output_tail": "Root cause: `to_cents` used `int(amount * 100)`, which truncates float error: `19.99 * 100 == 1998.9999\u2026` \u2192 1998, and `4.35 * 100` \u2192 434.\npytest isn't installed, so I'll run the test functions directly:\nThe bug was in `to_cents` in `ledger/currency.py`, and it's fixed. The function converted prices to cents with `int(amount * 100)`, which chops off the decimal part. Prices are stored as floats, which can't hold most decimal values exactly, so `19.99 * 100` comes out as `1998.999\u2026` and was cut down to 1998. Likewise `4.35 * 100` became 434. That threw off `test_subtotal_single`, `test_subtotal_qty` and `test_total_discount`.\n\nThe fix is `round(amount * 100)`, which rounds to the nearest cent instead of cutting down.\n\npytest isn't installed here, so I ran each test function in `tests/test_totals.py` and `tests/test_report.py` directly with Python. All five pass.\n\nOne limit to know about: `round` uses banker's rounding (exact halves go to the even number), so a price with more than two decimal places, like `1.005`, may not round the way you'd expect. To handle that strictly, convert through `Decimal(str(amount))`. None of the tests use prices like that, so I didn't change it.", "paced_wait_s": 0.0, "permission_rejections": 0, "read_calls": 0, "replies_ok": 6, "replies_throttled": 0, "requests_cache_read": 56862, "requests_cache_write": 19647, "requests_cost_usd": 0.1369034, "requests_count": 6, "requests_input_uncached": 14, "requests_output": 1362, "reread": false, "rule_order": "none", "rule_prefix": "neither", "run_id": "omp:trig-omp-multistep:claude-opus-5-5:trial4", "run_seed": 20261014, "sampling_observed": null, "schedule_index": 6, "score": 1.0, "started_at": "2026-10-13T05:22:31.521926+00:00", "subagent_resumed": false, "subagent_write_calls": 0, "success": true, "t_agent_s": 43.081, "t_checker_s": 0.383, "t_env_setup_s": 0.009, "task": "trig-omp-multistep", "task_calls": 0, "thinking_mode": "default", "thinking_sent": ["adaptive", "adaptive", "adaptive", "adaptive", "adaptive", "adaptive"], "timeout_s": 360, "tmpdir_leaked_dirs": 0, "token_basis": "proxy_measured", "token_basis_main": "estimated", "token_basis_proxy": "proxy_measured", "tokens": 1376, "tokens_cache_read": 56862, "tokens_cache_write": 19647, "tokens_fresh": 1376, "tokens_input_uncached": 14, "tokens_main_cache_read": 56862, "tokens_main_cache_write": 19647, "tokens_main_calls": 6, "tokens_main_input_uncached": 14, "tokens_main_output": 1362, "tokens_output": 1362, "tokens_proxy_cache_read": 56862, "tokens_proxy_cache_write": 19647, "tokens_proxy_calls": 6, "tokens_proxy_input_uncached": 14, "tokens_proxy_output": 1362, "tokens_proxy_reasoning": null, "tokens_reasoning": 0, "trial": 4, "ts_iso": "2026-10-13T01:22:31", "turn_mode": null, "turns": 6, "usage_raw": [{"cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 11476, "cost": {"cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "input": 0, "output": 0, "total": 0}, "cttl": {"ephemeral5m": 11476}, "input": 4, "output": 112, "totalTokens": 11592}, {"cacheRead": 11294, "cacheWrite": 392, "cost": {"cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "input": 0, "output": 0, "total": 0}, "cttl": {"ephemeral5